sy.\n(Option A) Bone marrow biopsy and aspiration may be used for many conditions, such as leukopenia, leukocytosis, thrombocytopenia, thrombocytosis, pancytopenia and polycythemia. This test would be used if anemia could not be justified by iron\ndeficiency, or if the patient, besides the anemia, has any of the above features.\n(Option C) Serum electrophoresis is the test of choice to confirm thalassemia as the cause of anemia. Although the full blood exam (FBE) of this patient resembles thalassemia trait, the low ferritin level in this patient is against it because in patients\nwith thalassemia, ferritin and iron or either normal or elevated. Since thalassemia cannot cause iron deficiency anemia, serum electrophoresis adds no diagnostic value in this patient.","source_answer_status":"present","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","screen","screening"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"very_high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"59624c08892e0925d69d6630ddd73c18b4c6da48","duplicate_group_id":"exact-59624c08892e","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"f5ca165d2f8e3cc621a5","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":633,"source_qid":"1538"}]}',1,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
