Metastatic brain tumors are the most common form of brain tumors. Of all brain tumors, more than a half are metastatic. In patients with systemic malignancies, brain metastases occur in 10-30% of adults and 6-10% of children.
(Option A) With the high probability of an underlying lung cancer in this patient, this tumor is more likely to be metastatic than primary.
(Option C) Brain abscess has similar appearance on contrast CT scan (ring enhancement); however, with absence of fever and considering the history, a brain abscess is not a likely diagnosis.
(Options D and E) The appearance of the lesion as well as the insidious onset and progression of the symptoms make cerebral hemorrhage and ischemic stroke unlikely diagnoses.',NULL,'Retain the source-era answer for question-bank study; verify current Australian guidance before clinical use.',NULL,NULL,'2023','v2.9.4',1,'text','{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"621","duplicate_group_id":"exact-3be7d49bd702","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"10363a04076f25ac8300","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":758,"source_qid":"621"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"native","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium') ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET source_id=excluded.source_id,source_question_no=excluded.source_question_no,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,system=excluded.system,topic=excluded.topic,clinical_task=excluded.clinical_task,stem_en=excluded.stem_en,answer_key=excluded.answer_key,source_explanation_en=excluded.source_explanation_en,memory_rule_en=excluded.memory_rule_en,image_ref=excluded.image_ref,source_year=excluded.source_year,import_version=excluded.import_version,active=1,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk;
